Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1981年 莱茵辛巴赫瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1891 the Reichenbach Falls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瑞士马灵顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}near Marlington in Switzerland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯夏洛克终于和莫里亚蒂教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes finally closed his{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}决一死战\N{\fnArial\fs30}account with Professor Moriarty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂是当时最危险的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most dangerous criminal of his generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个人在险要之地单独决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two men were alone in that dreadful place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the outcome of their struggle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如如人人所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}was obvious to a trained observer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯击败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes had achieved the destruction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的死敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}of his archenemy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他自己也付出了生命的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}only at the cost of his own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:33.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《空屋》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我亲爱的朋友去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now three long years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经过去漫长的三年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since my dear friend plunged to his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那漩涡激荡的无底深渊中\N{\fnArial\fs30}There deep down under the swirling water{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当代最危险的罪犯莫里亚蒂教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}the infamous Professor Moriarty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和当代最杰出的护法卫士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the foremost champion of law of his generation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将永远长眠在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}will lie together for all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦的每一个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is hardly a corner of London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会令我忆起自己的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}that does not remind me of my old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再也未曾踏足贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never walk down Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们一起在那里渡过的日子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we shared rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经历了无数惊心动魄的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}for so many eventful years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能让我脑海总是浮现出\N{\fnArial\fs30}without it reminding me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去的往事\N{\fnArial\fs30}only too keenly of the past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有那位我认为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the loss of one I shall ever regard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上最优秀聪明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the best and wisest man I have ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仍对刑事案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retained a keen interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.66,0:02:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保持着浓厚的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}in criminal matters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过做警局的法医\N{\fnArial\fs30}and supplemented my meager practice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来补充匮乏的消息来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}by working as a police surgeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是1894年的早春\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in the early spring of 1894{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一大早便应约\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was called out early in the morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前往西郊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to an appointment in the west end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德警探正等你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Lestrade is waiting for you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二楼 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}first floor sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警探？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一大早的麻烦你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early call I'm afraid Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可是尊敬的罗诺德·阿德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Honorable Ronald Adair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请不要放在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not there sir if you please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}23岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Age twenty-three, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅鲁斯伯爵夫妇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the second son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}次子\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Earl and Countess of Maynooth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他父亲是澳大利亚某殖民地的总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}father is governor of one of the Australian colonies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他母亲冬天住在伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}mother in London for the winter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儿子和女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}son and daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他一起住在这房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}are living in this house with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:03:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有发现武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh uh, this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是在尸体旁的地板上发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This found on the floor beside the corpse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一颗软弹头的左轮枪子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of those soft nose revolver bullets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}horrible things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是直接打穿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have gone right through{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的罗诺德的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the poor fellows head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不同寻常 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unusual, isn't it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一把手枪竟然有这么大的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a pistol to have such velocity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更像是一把来福枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是谋杀 警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's murder then Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有什么推断？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea who it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在为时尚早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's early days yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this one looks to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}as if it could turn out to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谜团重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bit of a puzzle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假设他当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well presumably he was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐在那把椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting in that chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他正在数钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose counting that money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀人者不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh the murderer doesn't appear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have been a thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿德尔整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adair had spent the evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都在俱乐部打牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing cards at his club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好最后一搏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for one last hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终于可以复仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we can get our revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德 你下多少赌注呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Ronald, what's the damage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想罗纳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Ronald{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能又出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't have gone out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到他大约十点半回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard him come home at about half past ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后没有再出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he hasn't gone out again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ronald?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ronald sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去撞开门吧 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's break it down my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从尸体的姿势来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the condition of the body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡发生在一瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}death was instantaneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想杀人者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose the murderer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是从窗户进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}came in through the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窗户是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The window was open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same spot of the matter is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何侵入者的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are no signs of any intruder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都没有 屋内外都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing, inside or out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不想大半夜从这里爬上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't like to climb up here at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有猴子才能做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been a monkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如你所说 那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you say Doctor, an impossibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像杀人者长了翅膀一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the murderer had wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种案子我们的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of case that would have interested{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯肯定会很感兴趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}our old friend Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么大的损失啊 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a loss he is Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不经常用他的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't always approve of his methods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他是私人侦探中最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was the best amateur there was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空前绝后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or ever likely to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were times when{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他做的甚至比我还棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}he even got the better of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Inspector, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该把他\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you arrange for our friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送到太平间去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be brought down the mortuary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我下午会去验尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll conduct an autopsy this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes indeed Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到时候再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you at the inquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（西敏市皇家法庭）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是警局的法医\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a police surgeon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你检查了已故的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You examined the deceased, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德·弗朗西斯·阿德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Frances Adair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本案受害人的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is the subject of this inquest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随后对其\N{\fnArial\fs30}and later conducted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进行了尸检？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a postmortem on the corpse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:10:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你有什么发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prey what are your findings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡原因是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well death occurred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}子弹造成的创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the result of a bullet wound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由一颗0.45口径的左轮手枪子弹引致\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a point four-five revolver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你紧贴事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to keep to fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的责任是确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}My business is to establish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本案的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}the facts of this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白您的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说子弹来自一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that the bullet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}0.45口径的左轮手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}came from a point four-five revolver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那纯粹是你的个人推断\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is pure speculation on your part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有责任妄自猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not your business to start guessing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凶器的型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the type of weapon used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这属于警局的职责范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a subject for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prey continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受害人死于致命创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death occurred as the result of a wound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该伤口由一颗软弹头铅弹造成\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a soft-nosed lead bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}子弹从左眼上方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet penetrated the skull{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头骨穿入\N{\fnArial\fs30}above the left eye, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:11:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贯穿左前脑叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}traversing the left frontal lobe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}击穿小脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the cerebellum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后经由左后脑腔骨缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then exited from the skull{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿出头骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the back of the head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从后脑勺射出\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the left occipital parietal suture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以你之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your opinion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡过程持续了多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when did death take place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该是瞬间死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh it would have been instantaneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}击中受害者之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}how far this bullet had traveled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}飞行了多长距离吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it entered the body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot be sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但可以确定的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it would certainly be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少在四五英尺之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than four or five feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡时间呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time of death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.99,0:11:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡发生在10：30至11：30之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death occurred between 10:30 and 11:30{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本月20号午后\N{\fnArial\fs30}post meridian on the twentieth of this month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 医生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Doctor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德·阿德尔和我一起打板球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Adair and I played cricket together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个一流的击球手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a first-class bat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}脚下很灵活迅速\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty effective leg spinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.83,0:12:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好的运动员 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good sportsmen, in fact?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一流的运动员 法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely first class sportsman sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修长挺拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight as a dime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认识的最受欢迎的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the most popular fellows I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 穆雷先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Mr. Murray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·哈代爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John Harvey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是罗纳德·阿德尔的教父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Ronald Adair's godfather{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及财产托管人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a trustee of the estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 他的家人已经被\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course the family's absolutely devastated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的惨死所击垮\N{\fnArial\fs30}by this appalling tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带他一起玩惠斯特（牌类游戏）\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put the boy up for the Bagatelle Cup{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a matter of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很喜欢打牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always he enjoyed the game of cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不论输赢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win or lose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}输赢会不会影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that affect Mr. Adair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿德尔先生的心情 约翰伯爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in any way, Sir John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法官大人 一点也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord no, not in the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从来不会因为输钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never paid such high stakes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而影响到自己的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could affect him at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的家境\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常富裕\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a very considerable one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 约翰爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Sir John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您帮了很大的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been a great help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像你这么德高望重的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and may I say that evidence from such{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所提供的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}a distinguished person, as yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我们来说相当有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}is greatly valued by the court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Moran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是最后一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the last person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与阿德尔先生见面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}known to of seen Mr. Adair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很了解他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know him well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢说很了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't say that I knew Ronald Adair well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我和他爸爸梅鲁斯伯爵很要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew his father, Lord Maynooth, very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们以前在印度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to play{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经常一起打马球\N{\fnArial\fs30}polo together in India{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是罗纳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Ronald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我经常在俱乐部里看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen quite a good bit in the dark clubs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去几个月以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the past few months{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不时在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}we played cards together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玩牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}from time to time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英俊的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh charming boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}礼貌 聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good manners, intelligent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matter of fact, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是年轻人的楷模\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's just the stamp of a young fellow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倒是希望能他进我以前的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see joining my old regiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你注意过他有什么反常吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything unusual about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是不是很担忧或者不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he seem worried or upset{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那你见到他的最后一晚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the last evening you saw him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the opposite in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any idea why{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁有可能谋杀他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone should choose to murder him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他根本没有仇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt if he had an enemy in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 莫兰上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Colonel Moran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德巡官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Lestrade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能谈谈你对\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you give me your opinion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗纳德·阿德尔死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to the cause of the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么看法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honorable Ronald Adair's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被熟人或不认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willful murder by person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蓄意谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}or persons unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「被熟人或不认识的人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willful murder by person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「蓄意谋杀」\N{\fnArial\fs30}or persons unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马车 来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去肯辛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go to Kensington, carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位先生想见您\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gentleman to see you Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是急事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it an urgent matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有给你名片吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well did he give you his card?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾维 我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ivy if I've told you once{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过无数次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you hundred times, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的询诊时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}my consulting hours are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在外面清清楚楚的挂着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}plainly displayed outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.82,0:15:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes indeed sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以走了 艾维\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may go levy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在很忙 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am exceedingly busy sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 你是医生嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh of course you are Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个通情达理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are a man of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}富有责任心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}considerable responsibilities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说你把自己的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I heard you give your address{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给了法庭外面的马车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}to that cab driver outside the courtroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对自己说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said to myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定要去见见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just hobble around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位好心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see that Kind gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得有点过意不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a conscious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚才有点粗暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt a little gruff in my manner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant no harm by it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我其实很感激他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm much obliged to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.43,0:16:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我捡起了书\N{\fnArial\fs30}for helping me pick up my books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把这事想得太严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make too much of a trifle sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该去度个假 放松一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have spared yourself the journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不太冒昧的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you'll excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没空度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}No great journey sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我算是你的街坊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a neighbor of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定看到过我的小书店\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find my little bookshop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在教堂街的拐角处\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the corner of Church Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy to see you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sure that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概… 你也收藏书吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps… you collect…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:43.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这儿有《英国鸟类》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have British Birds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:45.98,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍藏本的《圣战》\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite a rare volume of The Holy War{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每本都很便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}bargains every one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚好可以填满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the books you need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你书架上的空挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fill up your bookcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它更有分量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a little weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在看起来不大整齐 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does look untidy, does it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 介意我在你的询诊室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, do you mind if I smoke a cigarette{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抽根烟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your consulting room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万分抱歉 亲爱的华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand apologies my dear Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一点也没想到你会如此经受不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea that you would be so affected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道你还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it really be that you're alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的觉得现在有精神谈这事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you really fit enough to discuss things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.41,0:17:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧我这多此一举的戏剧性的出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given you a serious shock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给了你多大的刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}by my unnecessarily dramatic reappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, No, No, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But indeed, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hardly believe my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界上那么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good heavens, to think that you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}单单会是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you of all men-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}站在我的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be here in my consulting room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么样 你不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you're not a spirit at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear chap, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到你我太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm overjoyed to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐下 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, sit down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我你是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me how you came alive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那可怕的峡谷中逃生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of that awful chasm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴能伸直腰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I'm glad to stretch myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让一个高个子一连几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no joke when a tall man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弯腰驼背\N{\fnArial\fs30}has to take a foot off his stature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不是件轻松的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}for several hours on end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, my dear fellow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个晚上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a hard and dangerous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艰险工作等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}night's work ahead of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许最好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it would be better{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等这项工作完了以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I gave you an account of the whole situation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再把全部是情况告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}when that work is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm full of curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更喜欢现在就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should much prefer to hear now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚愿意跟我一起去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will come with me tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随你说什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去什么地方都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的还像过去那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just like the old days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们出发前还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have a chance for a mouthful of dinner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃点晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we need go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你得先告诉我所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but first you must tell me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定没关系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说那个峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}about that chasm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要爬上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no serious difficulty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本没有什么难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}in getting out of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.65,0:19:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the very simple reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本就没掉进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was never in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你根本没掉进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本没掉进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never was in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我在莱辛巴赫瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}The note that I left on the rock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你留的便条\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Reichenbach Falls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was absolutely genuine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一点也不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had little doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的末日到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my career had come to an end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我发现邪恶的莫里亚蒂的身影\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I perceived the somewhat sinister figure of Moriarty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就站在狭窄的走道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing upon the narrow pathway{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那条窄道通向安全地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}that led to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.39,0:19:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他灰色的眼睛里我看到了邪恶的意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read an inexorable purpose in his gray eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得到他的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to obtain his courteous permission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写下了一张便条\N{\fnArial\fs30}to write the note, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你后来看到的那张\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you afterwards received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将它视若珍宝 好好保存着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has remained my treasured possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到几个月后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a few months later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我津津有味的读到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I read with great interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我的死的描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}your description of my death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}写得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was excellently done, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满生动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most picturesque{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而刺激的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and exciting piece of fiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我发自内心的高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I'm certainly glad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the bottom of my heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并没有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was fiction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是究竟发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what did really happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我走到岩架\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I reached the ledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我站在峭壁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stood at bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他并没有掏出武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drew no weapon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是冲了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but rushed at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.38,0:21:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用他颀长的胳膊抱住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and threw his long arms around me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他知道一切都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew that his game was up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只急着报复我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was only anxious to revenge himself upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我懂得一些日式摔跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have, however, some knowledge of baritsu, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者说是柔道\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the Japanese system of wrestling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去好几次我都用上了这一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has on more than one occasion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}been very useful to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是… 你是怎么从那里逃生的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… but how did you get away from that place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可不是件让人高兴的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not a pleasant business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.76,0:21:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在莫里亚蒂掉进深渊时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even as Professor Moriarty disappeared into oblivion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我突然想到命运给我安排了绝佳的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}it struck me what an extraordinary lucky chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安全近在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate had placed in my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.53,0:21:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知道至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that at least{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个莫里亚蒂的余党\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of Moriarty's henchmen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想置我于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}would seek my demise now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这念头因为他们主人的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}With even keener determination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变得更加强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}to revenge their dead leader{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.38,0:22:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想最好让全世界都相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I could convince the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也一同丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I too was dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I decided{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}to disappear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那一瞬间的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}then and there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavens above.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那些足迹呢？福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the tracks Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个人的足迹通往下面 没有回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two went down the path and none returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是个富于幻想的人 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a fanciful person Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一点不假\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I give you my word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.22,0:22:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好几次 当我往上爬时\N{\fnArial\fs30}there were times during that climb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仿佛听见莫里亚蒂的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I seemed to hear Moriarty's voice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从深渊中\N{\fnArial\fs30}screaming at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冲我喊叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}from out of the abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后 我爬到了一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last I reached a place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有被人发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I was able to remain unseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.13,0:24:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.96,0:24:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那个隐蔽的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}From my concealed place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched you and your followers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.19,0:25:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充满怜惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}investigate in the most sympathetic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却毫无效率地勘察\N{\fnArial\fs30}and inefficient manner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.65,0:25:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我丧生之地的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}the circumstances of my death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.39,0:25:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最终你们都意见统一\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last, when you had all formed your{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.49,0:25:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做出了完全错误的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}inevitable but totally erroneous conclusions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.41,0:25:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you departed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是该上路的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was time for me to be on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.41,0:26:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 这意味着什么就很清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, the meaning of this was obvious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:27:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂不是一个人来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty had not been alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.67,0:27:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的一个余党\N{\fnArial\fs30}A confederate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.93,0:27:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在远处目睹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a distance had been witness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他朋友的灭亡和我的逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to his friend's demise and my escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.42,0:27:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的思考没有耽搁多少时间 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not take long to think about it, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.38,0:27:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拼命的跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took to my heels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.15,0:27:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在山里摸黑前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}and covered ten miles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逃出了十英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the mountains in the pending darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.95,0:27:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一周后\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.72,0:27:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到了佛罗伦萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found myself in Florence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.75,0:27:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确定这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the certainty that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.93,0:27:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.32,0:27:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道我的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}knew what had become of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.02,0:27:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只有一个可以信赖的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had one confidant-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.53,0:27:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.26,0:27:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须告诉他这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to confide in him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了得到我需要的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to obtain the money I needed to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.72,0:27:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得再三向你道歉 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you many apologies, my dear Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.07,0:28:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是当时最重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was all-important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.29,0:28:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让人们相信我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it should be thought I was dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.66,0:28:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要是不相信我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is quite certain that you would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.50,0:28:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也肯定写不出一篇令人信服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not have written so convincing an account{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.06,0:28:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于我不幸结局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my unhappy end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.77,0:28:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感人故事来\N{\fnArial\fs30}had you yourself not thought that it was true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.18,0:28:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我几次要提笔写信给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have taken up my pen to write to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.06,0:28:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但总害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but always I feared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.45,0:28:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我的深切关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}lest your affectionate regard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.78,0:28:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会让你不慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}might tempt you to some indiscretion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.31,0:28:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泄露秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would betray my secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.44,0:28:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和你哥哥一样值得信任呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was as trustworthy as your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.24,0:28:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然是 华生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are Watson…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.13,0:28:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你更加善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have a kinder heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.72,0:28:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是你这些年都在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what have you done all these long years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.50,0:28:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也许看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you may have read{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.75,0:28:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位名叫西格森的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the remarkable explorations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.24,0:29:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挪威探险家的考察报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a Norwegian called Sigerson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.42,0:29:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我保证你从没有想到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am sure that it never occurred to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.23,0:29:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were receiving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.83,0:29:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你朋友的见闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}news of your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.61,0:29:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在西藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}For two years I traveled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.39,0:29:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游历了两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Tibet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.48,0:29:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常以去拉萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and amused myself by visiting Lhasa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.60,0:29:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和大喇嘛聊天消磨时光为乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and spending some time with the head Lama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.08,0:29:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后我又去了波斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I then moved to Persia, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.55,0:29:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到喀土穆对哈里法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and paid a short but interesting visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做了简短而有趣的拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Khalifa in Khartoum, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.53,0:29:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并把拜访的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}the results of which I have passed on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.20,0:29:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交给外交部的凯彻姆部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Lord Ketchum in the Foreign Office, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.87,0:29:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 是匿名\N{\fnArial\fs30}anonymously of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.23,0:29:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说你亲眼见到了皇宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you actually saw the palace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.70,0:29:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戈登被谋杀的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Gordon was murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.99,0:29:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凄惨的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a sorry sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.99,0:29:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的血还残留在夹克上\N{\fnArial\fs30}His blood still upon his jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.76,0:29:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近我去了法国蒙特利尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lately I've been in France in Montpellier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.68,0:29:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}研究煤焦油的衍生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to research the coal tar derivatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.51,0:29:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这时候发生了这件惊人的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then came the news of this remarkable murder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.86,0:29:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}案件的离奇吸引了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}which not only appealed to my by its own merits, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.96,0:30:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎给我个人带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but would seem to offer some most peculiar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.89,0:30:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最难得的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}personal opportunities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.02,0:30:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我立刻回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.97,0:30:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来过贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been to Baker Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.48,0:30:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天早上 我自己打了个电话回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called there this morning in my own person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.81,0:31:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特把我屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft had preserved my rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.60,0:31:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和文件原模原样保存着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my papers exactly as they had always been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.62,0:31:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.70,0:31:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I found myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.78,0:31:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到了我的老房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my old rooms, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐在原来的椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting in my old chair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.85,0:31:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}满心希望能见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only wishing that I could have seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.34,0:31:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的老朋友 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dear friend, Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也坐在对面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting in the other chair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一向常坐的椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he has so often adorned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.08,0:31:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正是这样希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I hope I will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.18,0:31:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么值得非凡的故事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… what a remarkable story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的左轮手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still in possession{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.12,0:31:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your Army revolver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.96,0:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I think I have it somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:32:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确保你晚上带在身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that you bring it with you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.84,0:32:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给咱俩安排了一点工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have piece of work for both of us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.93,0:32:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果咱们能成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which if we bring to a successful conclusion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结束它\N{\fnArial\fs30}will in itself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.86,0:32:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就不枉活在世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}justify a man's life on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.21,0:32:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你讲详细点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to tell me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.40,0:32:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天亮前够你听和看的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will see and hear enough before morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.18,0:32:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.78,0:32:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能占用一会儿你的病床吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I occupy your couch for a few hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.39,0:32:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海上的航行极其艰苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea was exceeding rough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.89,0:32:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}穿过海峡时\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the channel crossing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又一次看到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the prospect of seeing London again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.92,0:32:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要和一个莫里亚蒂的余党\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an intimate encounter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.35,0:32:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进行一场激烈的决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of Moriarty's confederates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.09,0:32:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加上将要看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus the added pleasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.83,0:32:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老朋友华生的兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}of seeing my old friend Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.60,0:32:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而之后在火车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite prohibited sleep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.96,0:32:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}辗转反侧难以入眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the railway train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.38,0:32:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 福尔摩斯 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Holmes, please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以睡我的床啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}my bedroom is at your disposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, No, No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.38,0:32:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个挺舒服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will suit me very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去的几年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had harder beds than this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.87,0:32:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我睡过比着还硬的床呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the past few years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.04,0:35:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道我们在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where we are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.54,0:35:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 那是贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely that is Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.90,0:35:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.39,0:35:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这间空屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the empty house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.82,0:35:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正对着我们的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}opposite our old quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么要来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.54,0:35:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为从这里可以清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it commands such an excellent a view{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到对面的楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}of that picturesque pile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.82,0:35:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦你 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I trouble you, Watson, to be so kind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠窗户近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to draw a little nearer to the window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.05,0:35:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心别暴露自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking every precaution not to reveal yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.42,0:35:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再看看我们的房间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then to look into our old rooms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.20,0:35:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让咱们看看我离开这三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see where the three years of absence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.08,0:35:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是完全失去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have entirely taken away my power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.90,0:35:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你惊奇的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to surprise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good heavens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.72,0:36:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妙极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's marvelous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.67,0:36:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信我变化多端的手法尚未因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust that age doth not wither nor custom stale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.87,0:36:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岁月流逝而枯竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}my infinite variety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.65,0:36:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确有几分像我 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is rather like me, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以发誓说那就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be prepared to swear it was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.34,0:36:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}功劳归于\N{\fnArial\fs30}The construction is due to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.76,0:36:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格勒诺布尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Monsieur Oscar Meunier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.23,0:36:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥斯卡莫尼埃先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Grenoble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.69,0:36:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是一座蜡像\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bust is in wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其余是今天下午\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest I arranged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.82,0:36:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在贝克街自己布置的\N{\fnArial\fs30}during my visit to Baker Street earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.36,0:36:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我有最大的必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have the strongest possible reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.85,0:36:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让某些人相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}for wishing certain people to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.81,0:37:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实我并不在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was really elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.79,0:37:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为有人在监视你的房子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought the rooms were watched?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.64,0:37:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道有人在监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that they were being watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.90,0:37:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.89,0:37:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可爱的一帮人里\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the one remaining member{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.31,0:37:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅剩的一位宿敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}of that charming society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.84,0:37:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的头子此刻正躺在莱辛巴赫瀑布下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose leader lies in the Reichenbach Falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.96,0:37:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他相信早晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later he believed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.52,0:37:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would come back to my rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.09,0:37:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以派人不断进行监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he had them watched continuously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.29,0:37:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早他们看到我到达伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was observed when I arrived this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.57,0:37:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到了放哨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognized the sentinel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.90,0:37:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姓巴克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker by name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.89,0:37:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以杀人抢劫为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}a garrotter by trade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.26,0:37:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个出色的犹太口琴演奏家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a remarkable expert Upon the jew's-harp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.30,0:37:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I understand the reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.73,0:37:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么要扮成老书商了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the old bookseller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.25,0:38:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎巴克尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cared not about Parker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.90,0:38:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我非常担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I care a great deal about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.36,0:38:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他背后那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}the much more formable person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.10,0:38:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更加难对付的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is behind him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.92,0:38:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂的把兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bosom friend of Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.26,0:38:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚在追我的正好是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the man who is after me tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.12,0:38:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let us hope that he is also the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.10,0:38:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他并不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is totally unaware{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.53,0:38:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实是我们在追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we are after him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.25,0:38:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.17,0:39:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看\N{\fnArial\fs30}look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.82,0:39:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在楼那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just beyond the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.79,0:39:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门口那两个人影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of shady characters in the doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.43,0:39:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes I see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是不是该做点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well shouldn't we do something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.07,0:39:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.65,0:39:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.74,0:39:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}影子动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shadow's moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.28,0:39:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然会动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly it has moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.54,0:39:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让哈德森太太这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I involved Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.42,0:39:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这里待了两个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been in this room two hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.75,0:39:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已经把蜡像的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she has made some change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.70,0:39:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变动八次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that figure eight times, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.30,0:39:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每一刻钟换一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}or once every quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.16,0:43:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.39,0:43:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雷斯垂德 见到你太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade how nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.31,0:43:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it really is you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.29,0:43:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我接到你的信时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I received your message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.30,0:43:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could scarce believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.04,0:43:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你需要点非官方的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to want some unofficial help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.51,0:43:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年中有三起谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three undetected murders in one year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.25,0:43:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}破不了是不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't do you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.71,0:43:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我认识这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes I know this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然认识 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.28,0:43:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警探先生也认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does the Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.64,0:43:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛巴斯蒂恩·莫兰上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Sebastian Moran, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.43,0:43:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前在女王陛下的印度军中效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}once of Her Majesty's Indian Army, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.69,0:43:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咱们东方帝国造就的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the best heavy game shot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.29,0:43:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最优秀的射手\N{\fnArial\fs30}our Eastern Empire has ever produced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.42,0:43:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信我说的没错吧 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I'm correct, Colonel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.88,0:43:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的猎虎绝技\N{\fnArial\fs30}in saying that your bag of tigers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.48,0:43:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仍然是举国无双吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}still remain unrivalled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.88,0:43:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇怪 我这么简单的计策\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder that my simple stratagem{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.07,0:43:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能让一个老狐狸上当\N{\fnArial\fs30}could deceive so old a shikari.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.59,0:43:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是也经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have you not tethered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一棵树下栓只小羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}a young kid under a tree, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.22,0:43:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己带着来复枪躲在树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}laid above it with your rifle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.27,0:43:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等着你的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and waited for your bait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.70,0:43:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把老虎引来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring up your tiger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.92,0:44:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这间空屋就是我的树\N{\fnArial\fs30}This empty house is my tree, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.47,0:44:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是我的猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're my tiger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.54,0:44:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parallel is exact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.43,0:44:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能有或者没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may or may not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.86,0:44:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮捕我的正当理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}have just cause for arresting me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.47,0:44:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但至少没有理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there can be no reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.96,0:44:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I should be subjected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.88,0:44:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个人的嘲弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the jives of this person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我现在在法律掌握中\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm in the hands of the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.46,0:44:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都一切照法律办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let things be done in a legal way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.68,0:44:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的倒是很合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that sounds reasonable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.57,0:44:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走之前 你还有什么要讲的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything further to say before we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.56,0:44:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.55,0:44:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要以什么罪名提出控告？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what charge you intend to prefer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.43,0:44:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么罪名 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What charge sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.07,0:44:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是企图谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why of course the attempted murder of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.12,0:44:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯夏洛克先生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.75,0:44:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不成 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.46,0:44:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么出色的逮捕是你的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, and to you only, belongs the credit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.89,0:44:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只属于你一个人的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this remarkable arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.36,0:44:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以你惯有的智勇双全\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your usual mixture of cunning and audacity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.49,0:44:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.14,0:44:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand you Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.55,0:44:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓住了谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:45:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是整个警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man whom the entire police force{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.59,0:45:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直都没有找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been seeking in vain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.71,0:45:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛巴斯蒂恩·莫兰上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Sebastian Moran, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.90,0:45:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他杀害了年轻的阿德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}who shot the young Adair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.29,0:45:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上个月20号在阿德尔父母的房子外\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the open window of his parent's house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.96,0:45:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}透过敞开的窗户射杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the twentieth of last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.22,0:45:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是罪名 雷斯垂德\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is your charge Lestrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.93,0:45:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是这个案子的女英雄 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were quite the heron of the occasion, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.92,0:45:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是因为我很矮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I don't know, I'm short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.15,0:45:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切预防措施你都遵守了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you have preserved all precautions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.14,0:45:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.18,0:45:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跪在地上爬过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to it on my knees{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.40,0:45:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你告诉我的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just exactly as you told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.38,0:45:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我背上的疼痛可以证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a good crick in my back to prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.02,0:45:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我害怕极了 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I was frightened Doctor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.49,0:45:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当窗户碎掉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when that window shattered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.10,0:45:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I should have died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.74,0:45:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做的棒极了 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you did it very well Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.19,0:45:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有子弹的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sign of the bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.59,0:45:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.92,0:45:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我拿一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}a moment if you please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.56,0:45:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.34,0:45:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}子弹在我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.50,0:45:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从地毯上捡起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked it up off the carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.69,0:45:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是帮了大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson you are becoming indispensable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.78,0:46:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个软弹头铅弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soft revolver bullet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.16,0:46:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如你们所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you perceive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.48,0:46:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么巧妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's genius in that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.97,0:46:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁会想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}for who would expect such a thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.46,0:46:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会是从一把气枪里射出的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be fired from an air gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.22,0:46:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是一把普通的气枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no ordinary air gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.81,0:46:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.44,0:46:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非凡而独一无二的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remarkable and unique weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.56,0:46:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威力巨大却没有声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noiseless and of tremendous power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.71,0:46:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认识这个·范哈德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Von Herder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.11,0:46:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盲眼的德国技工\N{\fnArial\fs30}the blind German mechanic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.40,0:46:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这把枪是他给\N{\fnArial\fs30}who constructed it to the order of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.35,0:46:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂教授特制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the late Professor James Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.97,0:46:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.30,0:46:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老猎人居然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old shilkaris nerves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.97,0:46:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还手不抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}had not lost their steadiness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.43,0:46:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼也不花\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor his eyes their keenness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.99,0:46:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}惊人的准头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The results are appalling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.49,0:46:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.69,0:46:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在阿德尔被谋杀前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard of the name Moran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.32,0:46:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听过莫兰这个名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Adairs murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.92,0:46:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I had not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.04,0:46:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.09,0:46:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就叫出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}such is the price of fame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.58,0:46:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你从书架上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be so kind to hand me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.84,0:47:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把L到M开头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my L-M index?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.13,0:47:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传记索引拿来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our biographies Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.64,0:47:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收集的M部分材料很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My list of M's is a fine one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.20,0:47:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂这个名字不论在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind you Moriarty's name is enough to make{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.04,0:47:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是最出众的\N{\fnArial\fs30}any letter illustrious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.58,0:47:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得好像还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.05,0:47:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投毒犯摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan the poisonner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.36,0:47:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遗臭万年的梅里丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merridew an abominable memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.31,0:47:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有马修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was Mathews, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.97,0:47:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在查林十字车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knocked out my left canine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.20,0:47:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打掉了我的左犬牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Charing Cross Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.41,0:47:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后是我们昨晚见到的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awe there is our friend of last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.64,0:47:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛巴蒂斯恩·莫兰上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Moran, Sebastian, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.04,0:47:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原系英国驻波斯公使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Sir Augustus Moran, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.61,0:47:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥古斯都·莫兰爵士之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}once British Minister to Persia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.07,0:47:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾就学于伊顿公学 牛津大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Educated Eton, Oxford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.09,0:47:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}参加过乔瓦基和阿富汗战役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Served in Jowaki Campaign, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.79,0:47:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在舍普尔 喀布尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afghan Campaign, Sherpur, Cabul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.75,0:47:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}服过役\N{\fnArial\fs30}mention to dispatches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.26,0:47:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦第二号最危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second most dangerous man in London.'{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.98,0:47:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真叫人惊奇 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is astonishing Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.30,0:47:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这人还是个体面的军人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the career of an honorable soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.20,0:47:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在一定程度上干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to a certain point he did well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.87,0:47:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是有一些树\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet there are some trees, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.93,0:47:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在长到一定高度时\N{\fnArial\fs30}which grow to a certain height{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.32,0:47:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会突然长成\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then suddenly develop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.75,0:48:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难看的古怪形状\N{\fnArial\fs30}some unsightly eccentricity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.31,0:48:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点常常会在人身上看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will often find it in humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.23,0:48:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管出于什么原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the cause, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.38,0:48:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰开始堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moran began to go wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.90,0:48:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然没有什么丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without an open scandal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.91,0:48:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但仍然在印度呆不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he still made India too hot to hold him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他退伍了 回到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He retired, came back to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.03,0:48:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又弄得声名狼藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but again he acquired an evil name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.98,0:48:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was about this time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被莫里亚蒂教授看中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was sought out by Professor Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.87,0:48:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在瑞士时 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were in Switzerland, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.91,0:48:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰和莫里亚蒂一直跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moran followed us with Moriarty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.56,0:48:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was undoubtedly he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.99,0:48:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他给了我莱辛巴赫悬崖上\N{\fnArial\fs30}who gave me those evil five minutes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.59,0:48:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不愉快的五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}above the Reichenbach Falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.74,0:48:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我明白你为什么要消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well now I can understand why you disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.90,0:48:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有这么一个自由的危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a fellow like this, free in London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.35,0:48:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能性命不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}your life would not have been worth living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.13,0:48:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所能做的就是等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I could do was wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.43,0:48:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并留意犯罪新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch the criminal news{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.78,0:48:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道如果耐心等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing that if I was patient{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.50,0:48:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他早晚会露出破绽\N{\fnArial\fs30}sooner or later he would make a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.52,0:48:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我听到罗纳德·阿德尔被谋杀的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I heard of the murder of Ronald Adair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.88,0:48:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我的机会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that at last my chance had come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.94,0:48:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing what I did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.87,0:48:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这明摆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}was it not certain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.29,0:49:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是莫兰上校干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Colonel Moran had done it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.29,0:49:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他先和这个年轻人打牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}He played cards with the lad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.34,0:49:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随后从俱乐部跟踪他到家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed him home from his club{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.19,0:49:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从开着的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shot him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.07,0:49:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}射杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the open window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.54,0:49:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在对面的房顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the rooftop opposite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.97,0:49:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson does anything else{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.33,0:49:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要我解释的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}remain for me to explain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.69,0:49:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.22,0:49:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还没说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not made clear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.69,0:49:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was Moran's motive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.09,0:49:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗诺德·阿德尔的动机是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}in murdering the Honorable Ronald Adair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.21,0:49:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点我们只能推测了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we move into the realms of conjecture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.07,0:49:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各人可以根据证据做出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each may form his own hypothesis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他自己的假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the present evidence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.06,0:49:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你我的假设都有可能是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yours is as likely to be correct as mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.65,0:49:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你已经有假设了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson have you formed one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.32,0:49:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.47,0:49:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.90,0:49:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想说明案件的事实并不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's not difficult to explain the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.33,0:49:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本案显然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.66,0:49:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牵涉到一笔可观的金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}a considerable amount of money involved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.22,0:50:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰作了弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Moran had undoubtedly played foul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.38,0:50:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想阿德尔发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that Adair had discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.43,0:50:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰在作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.21,0:50:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能他私下跟莫兰谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very likely he spoke to him privately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.67,0:50:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还恐吓要揭发莫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and threatened to expose Moran unless he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.72,0:50:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非他自动退出俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}voluntarily resigned membership in his club{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.23,0:50:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并答应从此不再打牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and promised not to play again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.38,0:50:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson this is excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.72,0:50:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开除出俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exclusion from his club{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.11,0:50:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就等于毁掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}would mean ruin to Moran, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.85,0:50:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠打牌骗钱为生的莫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}who lived by his ill-gotten card gains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.76,0:50:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.64,0:50:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他杀了阿德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}he murdered Adair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.15,0:50:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it pass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.55,0:50:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, without doubt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.47,0:50:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说到点子上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have hit upon the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.70,0:50:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会在审讯时得到证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway it will be verified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.02,0:50:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是遭到反驳\N{\fnArial\fs30}or disproved at the trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.24,0:50:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 不论再发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, come what may, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.73,0:50:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫兰上校不会再打搅我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Moran will trouble us no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.16,0:50:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冯赫德尔这支了不起的气枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the famous air gun of Von Herder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.56,0:50:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将为苏格兰场博物馆增色不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}will embellish the Scotland Yard Museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.73,0:50:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.82,0:51:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再次 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.04,0:51:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以自由的献身于\N{\fnArial\fs30}is free to devote his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.10,0:51:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}调查伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}to examining those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.73,0:51:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}错综复杂的生活引起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}interesting little problems, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.57,0:51:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大量的有趣的小问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which the complex life of London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么好的礼物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}so plentifully presents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.97,0:51:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
